{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:726","content":{"id":726,"title":"插入区间","content":[{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"3f1a9544-b8f2-4c3c-a67e-50efccd738ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a492f324-31eb-4121-bfc0-ded2f17b7a90","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"无重叠的"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，按照区间起始端点排序的区间列表 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals[i] = [starti, endi]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示第 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"i"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个区间的开始和结束，并且 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 按照 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"starti"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 升序排列。同样给定一个区间 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"newInterval = [start, end]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示另一个区间的开始和结束。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8cfbe53b-b7a6-477c-ae4f-2cddb1c1ee72","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中插入区间 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"newInterval"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，使得 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 依然按照 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"starti"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 升序排列，且区间之间不重叠（如果有必要的话，可以合并区间）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"017916d4-8a57-4bb4-bb24-737427818e53","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"返回插入之后的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。注意你不需要原地修改 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。你可以创建一个新数组然后返回它。"}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例1","open":true,"tauContract":"6f651c7baafe7521ca6995109244b4d914c31407a4c181a83538b42acd722b1e","collabId":"54561fde-5416-48a9-9c2a-673ae8579bee","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ce5e4a97-ab4d-4189-b575-c88737719656","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals = [[1,3],[6,9]], newInterval = [2,5]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4f2030b0-05ae-4c30-9c8a-9acded5a4aa2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[[1,5],[6,9]]"}]}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例2","open":true,"tauContract":"6f651c7baafe7521ca6995109244b4d914c31407a4c181a83538b42acd722b1e","collabId":"e0b8306e-bf3a-4dac-8fac-5777be258da9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ecf8f8b4-854c-4929-965b-87e4b8ac9a79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals = [[1,2],[3,5],[6,7],[8,10],[12,16]], newInterval = [4,8]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d2a23821-c23a-4884-8339-0f2cf31b74d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[[1,2],[3,10],[12,16]]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b43fa2f6-57b3-4d8d-b2e0-96687a27d5ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解释：这是因为新的区间 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[4,8]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[3,5],[6,7],[8,10]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 重叠。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"515a82ae-56e7-4504-96f7-053be09b0875","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提示："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"de12a307-aef7-4566-89aa-e0f92d412f76","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b11bf30f-d4ac-42ba-bc61-0ee41a958418","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cfdc28ea-d950-4fd2-a135-abea78a1b3fd","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0 <= intervals.length <= 10^4"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f9349dd4-3e5b-4e3b-95c4-8e57366d3047","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fb253d0c-c3a1-4e5f-8b92-6cd3ca038b06","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals[i].length == 2"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"94c5baf7-a17a-4f0c-97b6-113c2f5d0a54","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e883cf85-e51e-4b11-b11a-ae1eb0bb2e70","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0 <= starti <= endi <= 10^5"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bd1387c9-fb34-4f38-bf4a-5d52237616c2","